#. module: odooapp_access_management
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:odooapp_access_management.view_aam_preset_wizard_form
msgid ""
"A preset creates a profile and its rules in one step. Nothing is\n"
"                    assigned to anyone until you say so, and you can edit everything\n"
"                    afterwards."
msgstr "预设可一步创建一个配置文件及其规则。在您指定之前不会分配给任何人，之后所有内容均可编辑。"

#. module: odooapp_access_management
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:odooapp_access_management.action_aam_profile
msgid ""
"A profile is a reusable bundle of rules you assign to people. Build it\n"
"                once for \"Warehouse Operator\", then attach the group - rather than\n"
"                repeating the same restrictions per person."
msgstr "配置文件是一组可复用的规则，您可以把它分配给用户。为“仓库操作员”创建一次，然后关联相应的组即可，而不必逐人重复设置相同的限制。"

#. module: odooapp_access_management
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:odooapp_access_management.action_aam_rule
msgid ""
"A rule says who it applies to and what they may not do. Start narrow -\n"
"                one group, one model - and widen once you have seen the effect."
msgstr "规则规定它适用于谁，以及这些人不能做什么。建议从小处入手——一个组、一个模型——看到效果后再逐步扩大。"

